{"text": "Every afternoon. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> After school. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The children went to play. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the Giants garden. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was a large, lovely garden. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With soft green grass. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There were twelve peach trees. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With pink and white blossoms in spring. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Birds sang in the trees. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the children stopped their games. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To listen. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> How happy we are here. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They cried to each other. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One day. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Giant came back. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He had stayed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With his friend, the Cornish ogre. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For seven years. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When he arrived. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He saw the children. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Playing in his garden. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> What are you doing here. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He shouted. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In a very rough voice. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The children were frightened. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And they all ran away.", "alignment": {"characters": ["E", "v", "e", "r", "y", " ", "a", "f", "t", "e", "r", "n", "o", "o", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "f", "t", "e", "r", " ", "s", "c", "h", "o", "o", "l", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "c", "h", "i", "l", "d", "r", "e", "n", " ", "w", "e", "n", "t", " ", "t", "o", " ", "p", "l", "a", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "G", "i", "a", "n", "t", "s", " ", "g", "a", "r", "d", "e", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a",